# Spike build context hygiene: no secrets, env files, local builds or VCS data in the image.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/secrets
**/*.session
**/*.sqlite*
**/mtcute-test.json
packages/db/src/generated
.git
.claude
.husky
design
docs
e2e/__screens__
playwright-report
test-results
